# Platform — Lead Form (M20-S01): LeadFormConfig aggregate; read-only config here (GET)
# UC-037: Manager configures the lead form module — config WRITES (audienceMode/questions/teaser)
#   moved to PATCH /tenants/hotsite as of M20-S08; see hotsite-admin.http's own "Lead form config"
#   happy-path block and its audienceMode/questions error cases.
# UC-041 (Trigger): status endpoint powers the dashboard's gated "Leads" nav item
# UC-041 (M20-S06): admin submissions read — paginated list + read-only detail
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl = {{backendUrl}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get current lead form config (default shape for a tenant with no row yet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER

###

### Status — nav-gating read (STAFF can also read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/status
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{staffId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: STAFF

###

### List submissions — paginated, ordered submittedAt DESC (STAFF can also read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/submissions?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{staffId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: STAFF

###

### Submission detail — full answers snapshot (STAFF can also read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/submissions/01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000201
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{staffId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: STAFF

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FAILURE PATHS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Submission detail for an unknown id → 404 PLATFORM_LEAD_FORM_SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/submissions/01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000999
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
